    //  ======================== THE TANK AREA ===========================
    //  A tank publishes its VOLUME, so each plan box is DECLARED as the
    //  bounding box of an upright cylinder that holds it:
    //    acetoneTank/tank1    13.83 m3: D 2.6 m x H 2.6 m (pi/4 x 2.6^2 x 2.6 = 13.80)
    //    recoveredTank/tank1   6.18 m3: D 2.0 m x H 2.0 m (pi/4 x 2.0^2 x 2.0 =  6.28)
    //  Redo the boxes when the hold times or the basis move.
    {
